{"lines": [["narr_01", "Placement season, reimagined. Meet A-A-F-T Placements, a Space on Twin Cafe."], ["narr_02", "A Space gives a community its own Twin, private to its members, trained on its documents, with agents built in."], ["narr_03a", "One Space for the whole batch and the placement cell."], ["narr_03b", "A student asks which companies are coming in December. The Space answers from the placement cell's own drive calendar."], ["narr_03d", "Another asks what Meridian Analytics will ask, and how to prepare. The answer draws on seniors' debriefs from past Meridian interviews."], ["narr_04", "Every recruiter comes with its own mock interview. Students pick a company and start practising."], ["narr_05a", "Students upload their CV, and get asked about their experience for the role they're applying to."], ["narr_05t", "They can practise all types of interviews, like case interviews, technical rounds, HR discussions and more."], ["narr_06", "From marketing to cinema, every school practises for its own roles."], ["narr_07", "Every attempt ends with a scorecard, a recording and what to practise next. Students practise again as often as they like."], ["narr_08", "Every question answered. Every interview practised. Placement-ready, around the clock."]], "alignment": {"characters": ["P", "l", "a", "c", "e", "m", "e", "n", "t", " ", "s", "e", "a", "s", "o", "n", ",", " ", "r", "e", "i", "m", "a", "g", "i", "n", "e", "d", ".", " ", "M", "e", "e", "t", " ", "A", "-", "A", "-", "F", "-", "T", " ", "P", "l", "a", "c", "e", "m", "e", "n", "t", "s", ",", " ", "a", " ", "S", "p", "a", "c", "e", " ", "o", "n", " ", "T", "w", "i", "n", " ", "C", "a", "f", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "1", ".", "0", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", " ", "S", "p", "a", "c", "e", " ", "g", "i", "v", "e", "s", " ", "a", " ", "c", "o", "m", "m", "u", "n", "i", "t", "y", " ", "i", "t", "s", " ", "o", "w", "n", " ", "T", "w", "i", "n", ",", " ", "p"